re a minimal valid JSON schema. The factory should strip the BOM and return a proper JsonSchema object.'}]}, {'group': 'JsonWithLeadingAndTrailingWhitespace', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'schemaStream', 'value': 'new ByteArrayInputStream("   \\n\\t{ \\"type\\": \\"string\\" }   \\n\\t".getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8))'}], 'expected': 'JsonSchema instance (non‑null) – whitespace surrounding the JSON does not affect parsing', 'description': 'The stream contains only whitespace before and after a valid JSON schema. The parser must ignore surrounding whitespace and produce a JsonSchema.'}]}, {'group': 'JsonWithUnicodeCharacters', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'schemaStream', 'value': 'new ByteArrayInputStream("{ \\"title\\": \\"Привет мир\\", \\"type\\": \\"object\\" }".getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8))'}], 'expected': 'JsonSchema instance (non‑null) – Unicode characters are correctly decoded and stored', 'description': 'A schema containing non‑ASCII characters (Cyrillic) is provided. The factory must read the stream using UTF‑8 and create a JsonSchema without errors.'}]}, {'group': 'JsonWithComments', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'schemaStream', 'value': 'new ByteArrayInputStream("{ /* comment */ \\"type\\": \\"string\\" }".getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8))'}], 'expected': 'JsonSchemaException (caused by JsonProcessingException) – comments are not allowed by default Jackson configuration', 'description': 'The input JSON contains a block comment. Since the default ObjectMapper used by JsonSchemaFactory does not enable ALLOW_COMMENTS, parsing should fail and the method should wrap the JsonProcessingException.'}]}, {'group': 'WhitespaceOnly', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'schemaStream', 'value': 'new ByteArrayInputStream("   \\n\\t   ".getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8))'}], 'expected': 'JsonSchemaException (or IllegalArgumentException) indicating that the schema content is empty or whitespace only', 'description': 'An InputStream that contains only